     "<span class=\"src\">Air-cooled chillers with free-cooling coils (air cooling): an air-cooled hall needs chilled water at about 13 °C or warmer (NREL for DOE FEMP, Best Practices Guide 2024, s. 5.2.1), and a dry cooler cannot cool water below the outdoor air (rated units leave it 3–11 K above), so chillers carry the full load in summer. Basis unit: Vertiv Liebert AFC FIZ135, 12.14 × 2.36 m, 2.90 m high, 1,489 kW at 35 °C ambient, 27.8 → 18.9 °C fluid, 30% glycol, with oversized free-cooling coils (Vertiv SL-71060 R09/24, \"Preliminary data\"; manufacturer claim). Chosen 29 Oct 2026 as the unit near…"
    ],
    "genLines": [
     "18 generator sets of about 2 MW carry 36.0 MW; with spares, <b>19</b>. Placed: 0 on the roof, 19 in the yard.",
